                        "form": "den Scharfsinn"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                        "entry_id": "db1e167d-0398-3eee-aed0-095e7eb8f804",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fähigkeit, das Wesentliche an einer Sache im Kern zu erkennen; scharfer Verstand"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6c2ff1a-2e9b-4d43-b234-a1d8c617bf5f",
                                "sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                                "text": "Mit analytischem Scharfsinn stellte A. Einstein, bei der Betrachtung der Schwerkraft, bereits vor 70 Jahren fest: Das unser Weltall nichts anderes ist, als das sich beim Urknall plötzlich der Raum auftat und die Zeit zu laufen begann; und es sich bei beiden begrifflichen Phänomenen eigentlich um den natürlichen Begriff der \"Raumzeit\" und dessen Aufteilung handelt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b72cb7a-bf00-44f5-9110-cbde33cec97d",
                                "sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                                "text": "„Die Liebe wird nur in der Ungedult des Verlangens unvorsichtig; aber wenn es darum geht, die Wiederkehr eines Glücks zu betreiben, dem widrige Umstände Hindernisse in den Weg legen, wird die Liebe alles mit größtem Scharfsinn sehen und voraussehen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de83bbbb-12cd-42b6-980f-cf30543a1109",
                                "sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                                "text": "„Er liebt Rätsel, Wortspiele, Hieroglyphen und entwickelt bei ihrer Lösung oft einen Scharfsinn, der den mit dem Durchschnittsverstand begabten Menschenkindern unnatürlich erscheint.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b654399a-fcc4-4338-9346-29f6010a8f6f",
                        "source_entry_id": "db1e167d-0398-3eee-aed0-095e7eb8f804",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fähigkeit, das Wesentliche an einer Sache im Kern zu erkennen; scharfer Verstand",
                        "target_lang_word": "acumen",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "acumen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83633bdb-a27c-3e78-b433-79e7648970aa",
                                        "entry_id": "d7c50dcd-f366-3bfb-8b1a-8e2af02a4f98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quickness of perception or discernment; penetration of mind; the faculty of nice discrimination; acuity of mind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6115db51-1c5e-47c5-ba16-4494de1c3213",
                                                "sense_id": "83633bdb-a27c-3e78-b433-79e7648970aa",
                                                "text": "\"I am going to ask you a question that does not require much legal acumen to answer,\" said Lord Meersbrook to his attorney, when he called the next day in Lincoln's Inn;..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "051bb9e1-87fa-450a-a471-126273354f82",
                                                "sense_id": "83633bdb-a27c-3e78-b433-79e7648970aa",
                                                "text": "Sunning himself on the board steps, I saw for the first time Mr. Farquhar Fenelon Cooke.[…]A silver snaffle on a heavy leather watch guard which connected the pockets of his corduroy waistcoat, together with a huge gold stirrup in his Ascot tie, sufficiently proclaimed his tastes.[…]But withal there was a perceptible acumen about the man which was puzzling in the extreme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "333d3762-28eb-4d20-9f31-8b428d0aa72d",
                                                "sense_id": "83633bdb-a27c-3e78-b433-79e7648970aa",
                                                "text": "No, no, my dear Watson! With all respect for your natural acumen, I do not think that you are quite a match for the worthy doctor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6ea48f5-cd85-425b-a567-11a95dd5ba47",
                                                "sense_id": "83633bdb-a27c-3e78-b433-79e7648970aa",
                                                "text": "Why do you think he removes their skins, Agent Starling? Enthrall me with your acumen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbfaa9a2-b3cb-4764-bd14-94fa1fd5ae41",
                                                "sense_id": "83633bdb-a27c-3e78-b433-79e7648970aa",
                                                "text": "[A]s [US president Donald Trump] turns up the pressure – calling the Fed chair [Jerome Powell] names and questioning his acumen – he’s ignited a firestorm in legal and financial circles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                        "entry_id": "d7c50dcd-f366-3bfb-8b1a-8e2af02a4f98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sharp, tapering point extending from a plant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e368b54-9772-4dc7-b43c-f0e9a0d0043e",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "The black star of the corolla, characteristic of the original form, the manyfloweredness of the inflorescence (often connected with [3]—4 whirls), upper leaves in the inflorescence, adpression of the acumina of the calyx, its size, the closely situated anthers, long pistils, the length of the pedicel above and below the articulation and the thickness of the pedicel dominate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fed1f822-a481-4d8b-9227-f44bf0d5fe82",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "11. S. boyacense. Resembles S. Rybinii from which it is distinguished by the greater dissection of the leaves, the longer calyx acumens, smaller anthers and coloured corolla."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5298841b-ba3c-454c-abe0-85734a206e64",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "Finally, the acumina of all the narrowly lanceolate leaves of both species tend to be straight rather than curved."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dbd9319-0156-4295-b2bc-338d2a9d3ec5",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "Herbs with long creeping stolons; leaves with coarse white hairs, or glabrous. The arched corolla lobes and large acumens give the corolla a circular appearance with acumens standing out sharply from it. Corolla occasionally, however, substellate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b98041fe-0fbc-44c8-867a-123efab012ac",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "[…] the stem leaves lack recurved serrations on the margins, the acumina of the branch leaves are usually distinctly dentate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf4dd4ab-4d56-4eb0-b8de-d77ec398061e",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "In our opinion, specimens of I. pilifera represent a robust expression of I. sinensis with many stem and branch leaves becoming strongly concave and broadly ovate to obovate in outline, thereby intensifying the abrupt contraction of the pilaferous acumens. It is best accepted as a variety of N. comes. The length of leaf acumens is another variable character expressed by Barbella amoena. Thus, it is also better combined with the var. pilifera as a synonym."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aabc0536-30e6-406f-b703-a5fd164ba116",
                                                "sense_id": "4a648dce-e5f6-377b-a9e2-49260c91f2f3",
                                                "text": "They examined the characters that were used by Paris (1908) to distinguish C. japonicum Broth. ex Paris from C. tonkinense: “Les charactères invoqués par Paris [Rev. Bryol., p. 46, 1908) pour distinguer la plante du Tonkin de celle du Japon s’évanouissent à l’examen, …”, and stated that the acumina of the leaves are narrower, and that those of the amphigastria are narrower and longer in C. japonicum Broth. ex Paris than in C. tonkinense."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a06d6823-95d6-3f72-b6ec-1cce13754500",
                                        "entry_id": "d7c50dcd-f366-3bfb-8b1a-8e2af02a4f98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bony, often sharp, protuberance, especially that of the ischium."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4478c638-7ff2-465e-8ca6-1b1f21f7ada4",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d6823-95d6-3f72-b6ec-1cce13754500",
                                                "text": "The rostrum is the anterior extension of the carapace between the eyes. It ends in a more or less acute tip, or acumen, and may have a lateral spine on each side or bear a longitudinal keel (carina) on the dorsal surface."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ceb9738-c0cf-498b-9af2-09ad052760b3",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d6823-95d6-3f72-b6ec-1cce13754500",
                                                "text": "DIAGNOSIS—Rostrum usually with marginal spines, tubercles, or angles at base of acumen, and rarely with low medina carina."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85f18cbb-a778-49ed-bf66-50e04d7e21a3",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d6823-95d6-3f72-b6ec-1cce13754500",
                                                "text": "Variations.—Most specimens examined have concave rostral margins that taper to the acumen and the rostral length is greater than the rostral width."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c14072c9-d5cb-44a2-a8dd-8725bf328f33",
                        "source_entry_id": "db1e167d-0398-3eee-aed0-095e7eb8f804",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fähigkeit, das Wesentliche an einer Sache im Kern zu erkennen; scharfer Verstand",
                        "target_lang_word": "perspicacity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perspicacity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b071de92-ffad-38af-ba3a-d6673bdce050",
                                        "entry_id": "cee14047-6da0-3da9-b670-d7413bf270b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acute discernment or understanding; insight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7417b32-0774-4cbf-a448-7c51b32ea649",
                                                "sense_id": "b071de92-ffad-38af-ba3a-d6673bdce050",
                                                "text": "\"I understand,\" I said. \"The fact is that you have the money.\" His face brightened. He seemed pleased at my perspicacity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cbded33-bd4e-4cb0-9845-125a86cc8e35",
                                                "sense_id": "b071de92-ffad-38af-ba3a-d6673bdce050",
                                                "text": "The citizens chose a university. They reasoned, with considerable perspicacity, that taxes come and go in response to political considerations, but a university, once established, is a permanent benefit to a city and a nation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eba190f-7c1c-43ee-a60f-73cc3ee67c45",
                                                "sense_id": "b071de92-ffad-38af-ba3a-d6673bdce050",
                                                "text": "McEwan certainly has a flair for unusual points of view. Adam, like the baby-in-waiting who narrates Nutshell, is an extraordinarily smart, well-informed, and unorthodox character who catches his supposed caretakers off-guard with his perspicacity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db027930-3817-3e99-88fd-a3df1f7dd9d4",
                                        "entry_id": "cee14047-6da0-3da9-b670-d7413bf270b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The human faculty or power to mentally grasp or understand clearly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5d8c9ee-27e0-42a6-bdb2-e4ad48143c1a",
                                                "sense_id": "db027930-3817-3e99-88fd-a3df1f7dd9d4",
                                                "text": "His very veneration for his father-in-law, combined as it is with a total want of the most ordinary perspicacity, is an additional disqualification."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6807ac3b-2900-479b-9b40-14f4c6324cd8",
                                                "sense_id": "db027930-3817-3e99-88fd-a3df1f7dd9d4",
                                                "text": "As the former consists in the transmission of psychic states inappreciable to the normal perspicacity or senses, the transfer cannot pass through the medium of intelligence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bff38cf-2266-3c86-947a-1faaec17263e",
                                        "entry_id": "cee14047-6da0-3da9-b670-d7413bf270b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Keen eyesight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03b9c08b-e446-4e17-a3a1-92690751adae",
                                                "sense_id": "9bff38cf-2266-3c86-947a-1faaec17263e",
                                                "text": "Attentive consideration of the phenomena of vision has led to the invention of artificial aids by which the sight may be wonderfully strengthened and preserved, and man endowed at once with the perspicacity of the eagle or the minute scrutiny of the insect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c952a3cc-ec08-4f36-8c7c-8f038402caef",
                        "source_entry_id": "db1e167d-0398-3eee-aed0-095e7eb8f804",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a99c0cc-cf61-32ac-9b1b-8f41ce5dd576",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fähigkeit, das Wesentliche an einer Sache im Kern zu erkennen; scharfer Verstand",
                        "target_lang_word": "perspicacité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perspicacité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10df89fa-3452-3590-9f2e-ba885355fc75",
                                        "entry_id": "28ee9dbc-ad99-34e5-be65-dddae128d88a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pénétration d’esprit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d3fbe71-f4c4-492e-a668-84081af3bc36",
                                                "sense_id": "10df89fa-3452-3590-9f2e-ba885355fc75",
                                                "text": "On comptait sans un incident, que certainement aucune perspicacité humaine ne pouvait prévoir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdcc1761-b738-4135-b4e3-2bf8fd328e23",
                                                "sense_id": "10df89fa-3452-3590-9f2e-ba885355fc75",
                                                "text": "J’ai rendu hommage à votre perspicacité tout à l’heure et je reconnais encore que vous avez fort bien pronostiqué en nous annonçant que le capitaine Brocq avait une maîtresse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7817b7b8-9a2b-4807-9dda-aeb566a54fbf",
                                                "sense_id": "10df89fa-3452-3590-9f2e-ba885355fc75",
